  "reviews": [
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJbQOYNQD1aS4Rr02JTGw23B0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KTFUwbHNPVFpZUTBkTGNrOVBTblp1ZWt4d1pHYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "I bought cheesecake brownies square (I forgot the name) and chicken karage bread. The taste was average. The topping in the roti chicken karage as so little so few and less I was surprised they didn't put any filling there. The cheesecake cost me 50.000 IDR the slice was thick but taste average. They also put cheesecake selections in the board which was not available, so unprofessional what's the point showing it to us right at the cashier. But the service was very well improved, they were asking me if I want to reheat the bread and the cake. Thanks for that. Overall it's really not worth it!!! Put more topping dong or filling. Compares to all the hype better go to Mako or Global Bakery Klender.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "I bought cheesecake brownies square (I forgot the name) and chicken karage bread. The taste was average. The topping in the roti chicken karage as so little so few and less I was surprised they didn't put any filling there. The cheesecake cost me 50.000 IDR the slice was thick but taste average. They also put cheesecake selections in the board which was not available, so unprofessional what's the point showing it to us right at the cashier. But the service was very well improved, they were asking me if I want to reheat the bread and the cake. Thanks for that. Overall it's really not worth it!!! Put more topping dong or filling. Compares to all the hype better go to Mako or Global Bakery Klender.",
