    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJbQOYNQD1aS4Rr02JTGw23B0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnNVNWUm5SVmhET1ZkR2VreGlZbHBzZDBaaUxVRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "They famous for their abon roll but you surely dont wanna miss their pastry!! Buttery, crisp outside moist inside, and its relatively big for the price. Their abon roll indeed yummm. I went there just when they got viral so maybe thats why staff seems overwhelming. Lots of goodies almost out of stock by just 10 am (they open 8am). Seating area is limited and staff didnt clean it up after someone's leaving. So trash is all over the table. But overall they serve good stuff! Worth to try.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
