    {
      "name": "places/ChIJbQOYNQD1aS4Rr02JTGw23B0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT204dE5tWnJTVWhGU1VSNGQyZHZRVWRsUjBNeVNtYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Discover an hidden gem of a bakery in East Jakarta, nestled near the railway! This place boasts an open kitchen, inviting you to witness the delightful sight of fresh bread and buns being baked right before your eyes. The star of the show is their incredible floss roll—or as locals call it, abon gulung. But be warned: it sells out in a flash! Make sure to get there quickly before it’s gone!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Discover an hidden gem of a bakery in East Jakarta, nestled near the railway! This place boasts an open kitchen, inviting you to witness the delightful sight of fresh bread and buns being baked right before your eyes. The star of the show is their incredible floss roll—or as locals call it, abon gulung. But be warned: it sells out in a flash! Make sure to get there quickly before it’s gone!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
