    {
      "name": "places/ChIJbQOYNQD1aS4Rr02JTGw23B0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sMGJHSXpNRzFEZEdGVk9XZE9hMFU1WTNGRlVYYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "Dropped by this afternoon and picked up their tiramisu donut, chocolate sourdough, cheese bread, and srikaya bread—everything tasted OK!\n\nMy only gripe is that there weren't many options left late in the afternoon, and a lot of the trays were already empty. Definitely come earlier if you want the full selection (or not?). Still, a solid bakery spot in Klender tho!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
